WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.050
Did you know that in One Piece there are Eighteen
different races in One Piece and only three

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:07.169
other them can control elements like water
and fire?

00:00:07.169 --> 00:00:13.220
Or that we have confirmed proof of a one-thousand
year long war that began well before the void

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.220
century?

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:19.340
Or that there are three ANCIENT, MAGICAL trees
that are all thousands of years old, and one

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.990
of them is might even grow inside of the Red
Line?

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:28.990
Well, today we are diving down the One Piece
Lore Iceberg, going from the the most surface

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:35.879
level lore that even the most casual fans
should know down to the absolute deepest and

00:00:35.879 --> 00:00:42.110
darkest secrets of tier 6 where the most secret
and wild things about One Piece, like the

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:45.930
crucial role that whales play in protecting
the one piece

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:51.880
But starting with Tier 1 or the tip of the
iceberg, which is the most surface level lore

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:52.880
that most casual fans should know

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:57.700
And why not kick things off with the lore
that is SO IMPORTANT it is literally in the

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.550
title of the story.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:05.350
That is of course the actual One Piece treasure
which inspired the great age of piracy and

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:08.920
sent pirates like Luffy to chase after the
mythical treasure.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:13.299
Now, there are many things we do know about
the one piece.

00:01:13.299 --> 00:01:18.110
For example, we know that it is supposed to
be located on Laugh Tale, which is the final

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:19.760
island of the Grand Line.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:24.150
On top of that, the author has told us that
the actual One Piece treasure isn’t just

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:27.990
something cheesy like “the friends they
made along the way” or something like that.

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:30.010
No, it is something real.

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:35.540
In fact, the treasure is supposed to include
something that was left behind by a legendary

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:41.820
figure from the past and it also includes
all of the former pirate king, Gol D. Roger's

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:42.820
treasure.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:50.740
Plus, Roger and his crew are the only people
to have found Laugh Tale in over eight hundred

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:58.350
years, so even though this iceberg contains
tons of mind blowing secrets, this is one

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:01.220
mystery that is still unanswered even to this
day..

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:06.680
And if you have ever read or watched all of
One Piece then you should know about the poneglyphs,

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:12.280
which are these giant, unbreakable stones
that tell the ancient history of the Void

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.280
Century.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:20.500
Now, we’ll talk about the Void Century in
just a moment, but the MOST IMPORTANT poneglyphs

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:25.290
are these four Road Poneglyphs which contain
the information that you need in order to

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.070
find the island Laugh Tale.

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:32.750
And these are so important that the strongest
pirates in the world try to find or steal

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:38.280
them so that they can be the ones to finally
find the One Piece and become pirate king.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:43.000
However, those red poneglyphs are far from
the only versions of these stones, which were

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.440
hidden around the world by the Ancient Kingdom.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:51.800
And without getting too deep into Tier 2 iceberg
territory here, the Ancient Kingdom is a kingdom

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:56.480
that basically ruled the world before the
current world government defeated them sometime

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.830
between eight and nine hundred years ago.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:03.890
Now,&nbsp; the reasons for how World Government
might have defeated the Ancient Kingdom are

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:09.269
two spicy for Tier 1, so we’ll save that
information for just a few more minutes down

00:03:09.269 --> 00:03:10.269
the iceberg.

00:03:10.269 --> 00:03:14.390
For now, just know that the current World
Government somehow defeated the ancient kingdom

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.000
and took power.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:20.410
The worst thing about this though is that
the World Government then decided that all

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:26.090
history of that time period needed to be COMPLETELY
ERASED.

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:32.110
This is why that period of time is called
the Void Century, because almost all information

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:35.620
about it has been wiped away.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.830
All books were destroyed.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:40.280
Important people were killed.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:45.799
And even to this day anyone who researches
the Void Century or the Poneglyphs is hunted

00:03:45.799 --> 00:03:50.069
down and killed by the World Government, as
we saw during Robin’s flashback.

00:03:50.069 --> 00:03:54.739
Now, I’ve already mentioned the Grand Line,
which is the stretch of water right here where

00:03:54.739 --> 00:03:59.060
all the strongest pirates and marines are
located, but did you know that it also has

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:02.829
some important lore regarding the world as
a whole?

00:04:02.829 --> 00:04:07.620
Because during the Baratie arc we learned
that Sanjis’ dream is to find the mythical

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:08.620
All Blue.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:12.190
In case you forgot, the All Blue is rumored
to be a place in the world where the water

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:16.500
from all four Blues, or oceans, meet.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:21.090
And what makes it so special to Sanji is that
this place is said to contain fish that can’t

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.470
be found anywhere else in the world.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:28.590
And while we would love to see Sanji whip
up some brand new dishes, the important thing

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:34.320
for the lore of the world is that this place
currently doesn’t exist because the world

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:40.009
is separated by the Red Line, which is this
massive stone barrier that goes all the way

00:04:40.009 --> 00:04:44.690
around the world, and the Calm Belts, which
are these parallel stretches of water that

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.040
border the Grand Line.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:51.320
And while you might say that the All Blue
does exist right here, I think we can safely

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:57.070
say that this isn’t the All Blue since Sanji
already passed this way and didn’t think

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:58.370
it was the All Blue.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:03.060
Which might mean that later on something will
happen to the Red Line and the four Blues

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:05.789
will be reunited once again.

00:05:05.789 --> 00:05:09.930
However, you might be surprised to hear that
this wasn’t the only important world lore

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:12.560
that was dropped early on in the story.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:18.470
Because when we were introduced to the Warlord
system just before the Arlong Park arc we

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:23.280
all of a sudden learned that there were people
out there WAY STRONGER than anyone we had

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.600
faced so far.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:29.060
The important basics of the Warlord system
are that the world government will invite

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:32.030
strong pirates to work for them.

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:36.280
Those pirates get their bounty frozen and
can essentially do whatever they want, as

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:39.560
long as they come when the World Government
calls them to fight.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:43.780
And for now, the only Warlord that I’ll
mention in Tier 1 is Dracule Mihawk who we

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:48.340
learned is the strongest swordsman in the
world and even used to duel with the Emperor

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:49.790
Red Hair Shanks.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:56.220
And speaking of Shanks, it’s time to drop
some basic Tier 1 lore about the entire Emperor

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:58.600
system of pirates.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:03.470
This system is essentially made up of the
four strongest pirate crews who dominate the

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:07.569
final part of the Grand Line, which is called
the New World.

00:06:07.569 --> 00:06:14.169
They are so powerful that even the world government
struggled to defeat even one of these insane

00:06:14.169 --> 00:06:15.169
pirate crews.

00:06:15.169 --> 00:06:20.370
In fact, it takes the World Government PLUS
the combined strength of the Warlords to actually

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:26.479
rival the Emperors, which all together creates
the Three Great Powers of the One Piece World.

00:06:26.479 --> 00:06:31.590
And these Emperors of the Sea have been Luffy’s
main rivals during the second half of the

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:36.440
story, however, you might be surprised to
learn that the Emperor system hasn’t been

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:41.979
around forever because as far as we know it
did not even exist before Roger became pirate

00:06:41.979 --> 00:06:48.090
king and the previous era of piracy might
have only been ruled by one or two strong

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.090
pirate crews.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:54.520
Now we can’t talk about the strongest pirates
without mentioning the most well known abilities

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:55.520
in One Piece.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:58.300
I’m of course talking about devil fruits.

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:04.310
And while the true origin of these powers
remains a mystery many legends consider the

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:09.040
fruits to be kinda like pieces of the Sea
Devil that take the form of a fruit.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:14.569
Which means that by eating the fruit you actually
take a piece of that Sea devil inside of you.

00:07:14.569 --> 00:07:19.160
Although all of this is just legend and there
are some strong theories about the origins

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.810
of devil fruits that we’ll discuss later
on.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:27.320
However, once a person takes a bite of a devil
fruit, they instantly gain the powers of that

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:30.440
particular fruit for the rest of their life.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:36.140
The only downside is they can no longer swim
and will literally drown if they fall into

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.140
water.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:42.139
Besides that, it is pretty commonly known
that there is only ever one of each fruit

00:07:42.139 --> 00:07:47.289
in the world at a time, so there can never
be two people with the same exact powers.

00:07:47.289 --> 00:07:52.040
Oh yeah, and if you eat TWO devil fruits then
you’ll explode.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:56.810
At least, that’s according to legend, but
we’ve actually seen someone do this in the

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:59.210
story and they were just fine.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.509
More on that later.

00:08:00.509 --> 00:08:04.639
But one of the most interesting things about
the one piece lore is that there are many

00:08:04.639 --> 00:08:09.319
races in the world that have their own unique
elemental abilities.

00:08:09.319 --> 00:08:12.540
For example, the animal mink tribe have natural
electricity.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:16.070
The fishmen can control water to some degree.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:20.590
And these angel-like creatures even have natural
fire powers.

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:26.659
Those are just some of the many races though
because besides humans there are also giants,

00:08:26.659 --> 00:08:33.010
dwarves, long-arm and leg people, winged people,
and much more that we’ll discuss later.

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:38.479
What’s most incredible though is that all
of these races have detailed histories that

00:08:38.479 --> 00:08:42.209
connect together back to the Void Century.

00:08:42.209 --> 00:08:48.040
Many of them were even friends of the ancient
kingdom and still protect the Poneglyphs from

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:50.230
the World Government to the present day.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:56.029
Now before we get deeper into the iceberg,
here’s a fact that you’ve probably heard

00:08:56.029 --> 00:09:01.060
even if you haven’t watched or read One
Piece, and that is that Luffy’s childhood

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:05.360
friend Ace is actually the son of the former
pirate king, Gol D. Roger.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:10.490
Oh yeah, and he also died at the climax of
the marineford war which as far as we know

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:13.740
ended the bloodline of the former pirate king.

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:18.930
But in one way both Ace and Roger are still
alive.

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:20.180
Shocking right?

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:26.980
That’s because we are going to start Tier
2 with the idea of Inherited Will.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:33.500
Now, this part of the iceberg which represents
lore you most likely picked up on if you’ve

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:38.810
watched or read One Piece more than once,
and Inherited Will is one of those SUPER IMPORTANT

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:43.700
concepts that you probably don’t remember
as a casual viewer.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:49.860
The idea behind it is that if someone dies
without fulfilling their dream then someone

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:56.019
else who comes after them can “inherit”
their will and continue their dream for them.

00:09:56.019 --> 00:10:03.860
In fact, it can even apply to entire generations
passing on their will to future generations

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:09.110
This is probably best shown by Roger and the
Emperor Whitebeard who both weren’t able

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:13.760
to bring true peace to the world, but passed
their dreams onto the next generation.

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:20.610
To explain a bit further, Roger found the
One Piece but actually was too early to use

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:24.210
whatever information or power was left from
the Void Century.

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:30.579
So because he had an incurable disease and
was about to die, he turned himself into the

00:10:30.579 --> 00:10:31.579
marines.

00:10:31.579 --> 00:10:38.990
This allowed him a huge public platform which
let him inspire the next generation of pirates

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.709
to go search for the One Piece.

00:10:41.709 --> 00:10:46.279
The same can be said of Whitebeard because
with his dying breath, he confirmed that the

00:10:46.279 --> 00:10:51.760
One Piece was real, which further inspired
hope for the current generation like Luffy

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:55.250
to continue searching for the legendary treasure.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:11:02.170
And the idea of inherited will works on a
smaller level too, as many of the straw hats

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:05.260
have even inherited the will of their prior
mentors.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:11.990
Such as Chopper wanting to become a great
doctor like his first friend and Robin inheriting

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:16.730
the will of the scholars of Ohara to find
out what happened during the Void Century.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:21.320
Before we move much further though, let’s
dive in a bit more about the actual One Piece

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:22.779
and the Void Century.

00:11:22.779 --> 00:11:27.430
Because I just said that Roger was too early
to use what was left on Laugh Tale, which

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:32.870
means we need to ask exactly what this legendary
treasure actually is.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:38.180
Well, there are many possibilities, but to
truly understand the possibilities we first

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:43.740
have to take a look at the people we actually
know from the Void Century and what they could

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:45.650
have left behind.

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:51.279
The first, and most important, of these people
is the legendary figure called Joy Boy.

00:11:51.279 --> 00:11:57.430
And the first time we heard about him was
during the fishman island arc, when we learned

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:03.480
that Joy Boy wrote a letter of apology to
a former mermaid princess about a promise

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:05.040
that he could not fulfill.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:10.760
Now, we don’t know exactly what that promise
was, but we can guess that it involves the

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:19.020
fishmen having to live at the bottom of the
sea to escape oppression up on the surface.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:24.779
Which leads us to the most mysterious event
in all of one piece, which is the war between

00:12:24.779 --> 00:12:29.600
the ancient kingdom and the twenty kingdoms
who founded the world government.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:34.500
And while we don’t know a ton about what
actually happened, we know that somehow the

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:40.550
twenty kingdoms won, the ancient kingdom was
destroyed, and the poneglyphs were created

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:46.990
to keep the world government from completely
erasing the Ancient Kingdom’s history.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:53.449
Interestingly, we know these unbreakable stones
were created by the Kozuki clan from Wano

00:12:53.449 --> 00:12:58.410
who are just one of many allies of the former
Ancient Kingdom.

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:03.440
But after this great war, the World Government
was formed by the twenty kingdoms and they

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:06.130
have ruled the world ever since.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:12.660
As for the Ancient Kingdom, we don’t know
if they had an actual home island somewhere

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:13.660
in the world.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:18.260
It could have been Laugh Tale or it could
have been and island destroyed long ago, but

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:23.769
we do know that all of the known allies of
the Ancient Kingdom are not allies of the

00:13:23.769 --> 00:13:24.769
World Government.

00:13:24.769 --> 00:13:31.660
For example, the samurai of Wano, the Skypeople,
the Fishmen, Minks, and we assume the giants

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:32.660
as well.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:39.120
Plus, as we learned in Wano, there is a legendary
figure called Nika who was the Sun God.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:44.029
Now we don’t know if Joy Boy and the Sun
God were the same people.

00:13:44.029 --> 00:13:49.519
Both of these could just be a title that many
different people could have been called, but

00:13:49.519 --> 00:13:57.019
we do know that Luffy has now awakened his
devil fruit and inherited Nika and Joy Boy’s

00:13:57.019 --> 00:13:59.269
will to bring freedom to the world.

00:13:59.269 --> 00:14:04.649
Now, while much of the lore of the ancient
kingdom is still hidden, there are some absolute

00:14:04.649 --> 00:14:08.060
facts we do know about that time period.

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:16.459
First is that this giant ship was created
in order to carry all of the fishmen and merfolk

00:14:16.459 --> 00:14:17.459
up to the surface.

00:14:17.459 --> 00:14:22.709
We assume that this was part of Joy Boy’s
promise to the mermaid princess back which

00:14:22.709 --> 00:14:24.300
he was not able to keep.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.820
And with all this that we’ve reviewed about
the Ancient Kingdom, I think we can get a

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:31.779
pretty good idea about what the One Piece
actually might be.

00:14:31.779 --> 00:14:37.959
Because it seems the main idea that is usually
associated with Joy Boy is the idea of freedom

00:14:37.959 --> 00:14:42.180
for the many races of the world.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:46.800
So the One Piece has to be somehow related
to freedom right??

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:52.750
If that’s true the one piece could be some
sort of weapon or maybe some information that

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.930
will help defeat the world government.

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:59.820
However, while Joy Boy is the ancient figure
we are most excited to learn about, there

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:05.259
is one other LEGENDARY ancient hero that we
have actually met in the story.

00:15:05.259 --> 00:15:10.990
That’s because the Sword God Ryuma from
Wano was turned into a zombie that Zoro fought

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.540
during the Thriller Bark arc.

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:17.230
And while this was the first time we met him,
we later learned that Ryuma is considered

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:22.610
a national hero in Wano who once defended
the country during its golden era.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:28.500
What we don’t know is exactly how long ago
he lived, but it would make a lot of sense

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:34.069
to me if he lived sometime around the Void
Century since it would make his timeline line

00:15:34.069 --> 00:15:38.480
up with the other important people from that
time period.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:45.089
And sticking with Wano there is some very
interesting lore regarding the actual geography

00:15:45.089 --> 00:15:46.410
of the country.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:50.180
Because while we’ve had a few different
maps showing the layout of the oddly shaped

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.880
country, there are a few mysteries surrounding
the country’s origins.

00:15:53.880 --> 00:16:00.459
That’s because if you look at this map here
it really does look like Wano is made up of

00:16:00.459 --> 00:16:04.400
many different islands that were put together.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:10.790
What’s even weirder is that the weather
patterns for each of these sections are completely

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:11.790
different.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:16.240
So if you combine that knowledge with what
we know about islands in the grand line all

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:22.350
having their own weather patterns then it
makes a lot of sense that this Wano that exists

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:27.649
above the water might have once actually been
several different islands that were somehow

00:16:27.649 --> 00:16:32.510
smooshed together to create this new Wano
country.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:38.709
We even have a race of extra big giants who
are literally called Continent Pullers, so

00:16:38.709 --> 00:16:42.880
that is just more evidence to support this
potential lore.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:47.920
Now, you might be wondering why Wano would
be created like this in the first place, and

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:52.320
one possible answer might come from the lore
surrounding slavery.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:58.380
Because even though slavery is technically
outlawed by the World Government, it clearly

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:03.649
still exists as we see with the slave auction
during the Sabaody arc plus the fact that

00:17:03.649 --> 00:17:09.689
the Celestial Dragons ride around on slaves
and use slaves to operate their giant moving

00:17:09.689 --> 00:17:10.689
walkway.

00:17:10.689 --> 00:17:15.319
And this connects to Wano plus many of the
other allies of the ancient kingdom because

00:17:15.319 --> 00:17:19.799
there is some evidence to suggest that the
World Government and even people who ruled

00:17:19.799 --> 00:17:24.651
the world before them used to enslave many
of the people and races from around the one

00:17:24.651 --> 00:17:25.651
piece world.

00:17:25.651 --> 00:17:31.179
For example, about 1000 years before the present
story line, the animal mink tribe moved their

00:17:31.179 --> 00:17:36.250
entire population to live up on the back of
this giant elephant.

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:37.370
Why did they do that?

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:42.600
Well, the most likely reason is to escape
oppression just like the fishmen who moved

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.300
to the bottom of the ocean.

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:49.669
We also have the dwarf tribe that we met in
Dressrosa who once fled their kingdom and

00:17:49.669 --> 00:17:53.170
were later enslaved by the ruling family of
Dressrosa.

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:58.370
These dwarves were only freed once that ruling
family moved to the top of the Red Line to

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:02.090
become Celestial Dragons after the Void Century.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:11.740
So clearly, slavery has been a big deal for
a long time, and to bring this back to Wano,

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:18.150
it is possible that Wano was created as a
sory of santuary to protect a group of humans

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:23.860
and other races from the oppression of humans
or super powerful races.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:31.520
Speaking of powerful races, there is none
more powerful than the Lunarians, whose introduction

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:35.500
near the end of the Wano arc absolutely blew
everyone’s mind.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:43.040
That’s because this race of angelic winged
people once lived on top of the Red Line before

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:46.560
they were almost completely wiped out.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:53.140
In fact, they were once referred to as a tribe
of gods which makes me think that they probably

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:58.630
once ruled over the world, similar to how
humans rule it now.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:04.130
To explain what makes them so powerful, the
Lunarians get their incredible power from

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:10.490
this magical flame on their back which allows
them to create fire AND become nearly invincible

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.690
while the flame is active.

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:16.280
Now, you might be wondering how they were
defeated if they are so powerful, but that’s

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:22.690
a bit of lore too juicy for Tier 2, so we’ll
discuss it further down the iceberg.

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:27.930
What’s more important though is that the
current most individually powerful race is

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:31.190
without a doubt the giant race.

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:38.080
Because come on, these people are simply massive
and their average warrior is easily worth

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:40.400
one hundred normal humans.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:44.929
Most giants come from their legendary island
Elbaf, but what you might not know is that

00:19:44.929 --> 00:19:49.250
giants actually live in many places around
the world, as we learned during Robin’s

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.250
flashback.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:54.340
But man, if there is one island I am super
excited to visit next it is definitely Elbaf

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:58.010
because it has some INSANE LORE.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:02.870
First off, the entire island is based off
of norse mythology and we can see this based

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:08.240
on the design of their architecture, the name
of their ruler is Loki who is the norse god

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:15.140
of trickery and mischief, and also the fact
that there is this giant tree sometimes shown

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:19.690
in the background of Elbaf, which reminds
me of the world tree Yggdrasil from norse

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:20.690
mythology.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:25.980
However, while it is likely inspired by that
mythical tree, we most likely already know

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:30.200
that this tree’s name is the treasure tree
Adam.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:36.700
In case you forgot, we learned during Water
7 that the wood from this tree is UNBELIEVABLY

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:42.679
strong, so much so that Franky made the straw
hat’s ship out of it.

00:20:42.679 --> 00:20:48.470
Plus we know this tree is located in a war
torn country, which perfectly fits Elbaf.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:53.560
And while we’re talking about the Treasure
tree Adam, this is the perfect time to mention

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:58.460
that there are some other super important
trees in the one piece world.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:03.110
The second is the Sunlight Tree Eve which
we first learned about during the fishman

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.110
island arc.

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:09.260
This incredible tree absorbs sunlight and
then filters down light and oxygen to the

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:15.090
roots that are located at the bottom of the
sea, right above fishman island.

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:20.370
What you may not realize though is that we
don’t actually know where the top of this

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.370
tree is.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:26.440
You might assume it is directly above fishman
island since that is where the roots are,

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:33.789
but that is never confirmed AND right above
fishman island is the Red Line.

00:21:33.789 --> 00:21:40.779
So unless the Sunlight Tree is somehow part
of the Red Line or on top of it, then it could

00:21:40.779 --> 00:21:43.919
very well be located somewhere else entirely.

00:21:43.919 --> 00:21:49.440
And continuing with the theme of biblical
references, there is also the Tree of Knowledge

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:55.020
that was located on the island of Ohara before
it was destroyed by the world government.

00:21:55.020 --> 00:21:59.929
This massive tree served as the home for the
scholars of Ohara, who were a group that were

00:21:59.929 --> 00:22:02.660
dedicated to researching the Poneglyphs.

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:07.620
This of course led to their destruction when
the World Government came and destroyed the

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:12.990
island with a buster call, which also tragically
burned down the Tree of Knowledge.

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:19.010
And while we don’t know that this tree had
any special characteristics like the Adam

00:22:19.010 --> 00:22:25.610
or Eve trees, the planting of the tree of
Knowledge is actually the OLDEST CONFIRMED

00:22:25.610 --> 00:22:32.460
event in the story, which took place about
5000 years before the current story.

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:36.770
That’s not to say that the other two trees
can’t be older though, we just don’t know

00:22:36.770 --> 00:22:38.190
for sure.

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:44.169
And one thing that may hint at the treasure
tree Adam being way older is its sheer size.

00:22:44.169 --> 00:22:49.730
I mean, we haven’t ever seen a full, clear
picture, but there have been hints that this

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:54.170
tree is massive, like this image right here.

00:22:54.170 --> 00:23:00.529
In fact, it is SO MASSIVE that we know it
might even reach up to the sky islands.

00:23:00.529 --> 00:23:05.090
This was hinted at during the Skypiea arc,
when we learned that there is something called

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:11.809
the Path of High West, which is the normal
way that people reach the Sky Islands.

00:23:11.809 --> 00:23:18.090
From this, we can speculate that it must somehow
be some massive, safe, way for people to reach

00:23:18.090 --> 00:23:22.960
the sky islands, which just makes a lot of
sense for that to be this incredibly huge

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:23.960
tree.

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:29.850
Plus we have these giant vines such as Giant
Jack that could even be branches that spread

00:23:29.850 --> 00:23:32.150
out from this massive tree.

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:37.790
And now that we’re on the topic of sky people,
we simply have to mention the fascinating

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:42.770
lore behind these winged races that you actually
might have missed if you’ve only watched

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:43.770
the anime.

00:23:43.770 --> 00:23:47.370
That is because during Enel’s cover story
in the manga, we learned that sky people once

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:48.760
lived up on the moon.

00:23:48.760 --> 00:23:54.380
It is a mystery when they lived there or for
how long, but one thing that is certain is

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:58.919
that they were once up on the moon and later
had to descend to the Earth.

00:23:58.919 --> 00:24:04.120
Which is how two of the sky races ended up
on the clouds, while the third race found

00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:06.419
themselves down on the island of Jaya.

00:24:06.419 --> 00:24:11.220
And it was actually super important that this
Shandian tribe came down to the Blue Sea because

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:15.169
they eventually became allies of the Ancient
Kingdom.

00:24:15.169 --> 00:24:20.390
We know this because they have long guarded
a poneglyph that contains the secret location

00:24:20.390 --> 00:24:25.210
of an ancient weapon, which we’ll discuss
more about in just a moment.

00:24:25.210 --> 00:24:31.430
The Shandians used to be an incredibly wealthy
society, even making an entire city out of

00:24:31.430 --> 00:24:36.060
gold, but their downfall started when they
became involved in some sort of war, most

00:24:36.060 --> 00:24:39.960
likely during the battle against the twenty
kings during the void century.

00:24:39.960 --> 00:24:44.440
And we learned all of this during the flashback
during the Skypiea arc which told us the story

00:24:44.440 --> 00:24:46.520
of Noland the Liar.

00:24:46.520 --> 00:24:51.649
The important lore to know from this flashback
is that ever since the Void Century the Shandian

00:24:51.649 --> 00:24:56.230
people were protecting their golden city of
Shandora and the Poneglyphs until a super

00:24:56.230 --> 00:25:02.170
powerful water burst shot part of their island
up into the sky around 400 years ago.

00:25:02.170 --> 00:25:07.559
This put the Shandian people back into conflict
with the other winged races, and they continued

00:25:07.559 --> 00:25:13.080
their conflict until Luffy and the straw hats
brought them together during the Skypiea arc.

00:25:13.080 --> 00:25:17.779
Continuing with epic events from the past,
one hundred years ago the legendary captains

00:25:17.779 --> 00:25:23.210
of the Giant Pirate crew started their never-ending
duel on the island of Little Garden.

00:25:23.210 --> 00:25:28.159
Which is kinda tragic if you think about it
because two friends nearly killed each other

00:25:28.159 --> 00:25:30.470
over a simple disagreement.

00:25:30.470 --> 00:25:37.940
But nothing is as tragic as Brook’s backstory,
which contains a super important hint about

00:25:37.940 --> 00:25:40.120
the secrets of the one piece.

00:25:40.120 --> 00:25:45.870
Because around fifty years ago, the crew befriended
a baby whale named Laboon who had been separated

00:25:45.870 --> 00:25:47.220
from its family pod.

00:25:47.220 --> 00:25:51.779
However, the crew had to leave behind Laboon
once they entered the Grand Line and they

00:25:51.779 --> 00:25:55.230
promised to return once they traveled around
the world.

00:25:55.230 --> 00:26:01.490
Sadly, the crew never made it as they were
wiped out by a deadly disease, but the important

00:26:01.490 --> 00:26:06.929
part about all this is that ever since that
day the music-loving Laboon was waiting for

00:26:06.929 --> 00:26:08.230
his crew to return.

00:26:08.230 --> 00:26:13.250
And while that never happened, his presence
at the start of the grand line is just the

00:26:13.250 --> 00:26:19.480
start of some secret lore regarding the One
Piece that we will simply have to save for

00:26:19.480 --> 00:26:22.890
way down at the bottom of the iceberg.

00:26:22.890 --> 00:26:28.399
However, the entire time Laboon was waiting
for his crew there was this old man who was

00:26:28.399 --> 00:26:30.070
taking care of him.

00:26:30.070 --> 00:26:34.620
This is Crocus, and man when we first met
him I don’t think anyone would have believed

00:26:34.620 --> 00:26:39.050
that he is one of the few people alive who
actually knows what the One Piece treasure

00:26:39.050 --> 00:26:40.050
is.

00:26:40.050 --> 00:26:46.510
That’s because we later learned that he
was once a member of Roger’s crew when they

00:26:46.510 --> 00:26:47.880
found the legendary treasure.

00:26:47.880 --> 00:26:52.320
And aside from Crocus there is one other man
who the Straw Hats met who also knows what

00:26:52.320 --> 00:26:53.320
the treasure is.

00:26:53.320 --> 00:26:59.370
This is Silvers Rayleigh, Roger’s former
Vice-Captain, and surprisingly, those are

00:26:59.370 --> 00:27:06.539
the only two people we currently know of who
absolutely know what the treasure is.

00:27:06.539 --> 00:27:10.770
Although, there might be others like the leaders
of the World Government who might know as

00:27:10.770 --> 00:27:11.770
well.

00:27:11.770 --> 00:27:16.299
However, if we were to pick any other candidate
to know the truth, a good choice would be

00:27:16.299 --> 00:27:19.779
the world’s greatest scientist, Dr. Vegapunk.

00:27:19.779 --> 00:27:24.530
And we’ll discuss more of his lore and why
he might know about the one piece in a deeper

00:27:24.530 --> 00:27:29.320
tier, but his basic backstory is that he is
a genius scientist who has worked for the

00:27:29.320 --> 00:27:31.650
world government for many years.

00:27:31.650 --> 00:27:37.280
It is said that he is such a scientific genius
that he is technologically 500 years more

00:27:37.280 --> 00:27:43.220
advanced than anyone else in the world, and
his creations include things like these destructive

00:27:43.220 --> 00:27:47.549
cyborgs and even a perfectly cloned devil
fruit.

00:27:47.549 --> 00:27:53.760
Now for the final bit of lore in Tier 2, we
simply have to include the legendary pirate

00:27:53.760 --> 00:27:58.679
Rocks D. Xebec who nearly conquered the entire
world thirty-eight years ago.

00:27:58.679 --> 00:28:03.630
This man was considered Roger’s greatest
rival and he even gathered a ridiculously

00:28:03.630 --> 00:28:08.500
powerful crew full of future Emperors of the
Sea like Whitebeard, Kaido, and Big Mom.

00:28:08.500 --> 00:28:13.799
However, what you may not know about Rocks
is that he very likely had some secret connection

00:28:13.799 --> 00:28:18.830
to the former pirate king Gol D. Roger and
that they may have even once been friends.

00:28:18.830 --> 00:28:22.330
But now, enough with the casual, normie lore.

00:28:22.330 --> 00:28:27.940
It’s time to dive deep into Tier 3 which
is lore that you most likely know if you are

00:28:27.940 --> 00:28:36.510
plugged into the One Piece community and consume
One Piece content outside of the main story.

00:28:36.510 --> 00:28:40.160
Starting with the rest of what we actually
know about the Void Century.

00:28:40.160 --> 00:28:45.269
Because we’ve already established that during
this time-period there was a war between the

00:28:45.269 --> 00:28:48.860
Ancient Kingdom and the twenty kings who went
on to form the World Government.

00:28:48.860 --> 00:28:54.630
But what you may not know is that the Ancient
Kingdom was made up of allies from all over

00:28:54.630 --> 00:28:55.630
the world.

00:28:55.630 --> 00:28:59.380
We’ve touched on a few of them so far, but
to truly understand this we need to look at

00:28:59.380 --> 00:29:02.940
the most important clues they left behind
about their history.

00:29:02.940 --> 00:29:08.130
Of course, I’m talking about the Poneglyphs,
and let’s dive into exactly what different

00:29:08.130 --> 00:29:12.610
kinds there are and where we have found these
ancient texts in the world.

00:29:12.610 --> 00:29:17.360
So we’ve already discussed the four Road
Poneglyphs which point the way to Laugh Tale.

00:29:17.360 --> 00:29:22.320
But there are known to be thirty poneglyphs
scattered throughout the world.

00:29:22.320 --> 00:29:28.179
Nine of these are called Rio Poneglyphs which
tell the history of the Ancient Kingdom, while

00:29:28.179 --> 00:29:33.779
the others contain messages from people or
information about the location of other poneglyphs

00:29:33.779 --> 00:29:35.240
or weapons.

00:29:35.240 --> 00:29:41.010
Now, the first time we learned about Poneglyphs
was in Alabasta.

00:29:41.010 --> 00:29:46.100
This Poneglyphs was rumored to contain information
about the Ancient Weapon Poseidon that we’ll

00:29:46.100 --> 00:29:48.750
explain in detail in just a minute.

00:29:48.750 --> 00:29:54.659
But first, since Alabasta protected a poneglyph
for eight hundred years, that means this desert

00:29:54.659 --> 00:29:59.480
kingdom was most likely an ally of the Ancient
Kingdom in some way.

00:29:59.480 --> 00:30:05.110
And recent manga chapters have shed more light
on this complicated relationship, but we’ll

00:30:05.110 --> 00:30:07.190
cover more of that deeper in the iceberg.

00:30:07.190 --> 00:30:12.549
We also found normal poneglyphs located in
Skypiea underneath the golden bell, on the

00:30:12.549 --> 00:30:18.570
island of Ohara, and also in Fishman island
we found this poneglyph describing Joy Boy’s

00:30:18.570 --> 00:30:20.779
apology letter to the mermaid princess.

00:30:20.779 --> 00:30:25.760
The next poneglyph we found, which finally
opened up the true nature of these stones,

00:30:25.760 --> 00:30:29.240
was this Road Poneglyph on top of the giant
elephant.

00:30:29.240 --> 00:30:35.429
And it was at this point that the straw hats
learned that in order to find the one piece

00:30:35.429 --> 00:30:40.150
they would need to gather all the Road Poneglyphs
just like Roger had done.

00:30:40.150 --> 00:30:44.940
Fortunately, the next two Road Poneglyphs
had already been found and were under the

00:30:44.940 --> 00:30:47.900
control of the Emperors Big Mom and Kaido.

00:30:47.900 --> 00:30:52.899
And besides the Road Poneglyph, Big Mom also
held a few others which were also copied when

00:30:52.899 --> 00:30:54.899
the straw hats broke in.

00:30:54.899 --> 00:31:00.451
Which leads us to Wano, and after defeating
Kaido, Robin was able to read the Road Poneglyph

00:31:00.451 --> 00:31:03.860
kept hidden in the depths of Wano.

00:31:03.860 --> 00:31:08.679
However, these weren’t the only poneglyphs
here and it was during this final stretch

00:31:08.679 --> 00:31:16.260
of the Wano arc that we also learned that
the Ancient Weapon Pluton was indeed located

00:31:16.260 --> 00:31:20.520
in Wano, and Robin learned of this from reading
the poneglyph in Alabasta.

00:31:20.520 --> 00:31:25.351
And that’s all we’ll talk about the Poneglyphs
until deeper in the iceberg, but let’s stay

00:31:25.351 --> 00:31:30.419
on the topic of the most powerful weapons
in the world, the Ancient Weapons.

00:31:30.419 --> 00:31:35.980
And just to recap there are three of these
super powerful weapons and their names are

00:31:35.980 --> 00:31:38.419
Poseidon, Pluton, and Uranus.

00:31:38.419 --> 00:31:45.220
At this point, we know for sure that Poseidon
is the power to control the gigantic Sea Kings.

00:31:45.220 --> 00:31:50.139
The current mermaid princess Shirahoshi was
born with this power, and it is one of THE

00:31:50.139 --> 00:31:55.809
MOST important secrets in the entire story
because if anyone evil such as the world government

00:31:55.809 --> 00:32:00.250
or someone like the Emperor Blackbeard were
to learn about Shirahoshi’s powers, they

00:32:00.250 --> 00:32:03.870
would definitely try to capture her in order
to use her power.

00:32:03.870 --> 00:32:08.080
And just to be clear, this is a RIDICULOUS
POWER.

00:32:08.080 --> 00:32:12.809
I mean just look how massive these sea kings
are!

00:32:12.809 --> 00:32:16.730
Definitely an island destroying power.

00:32:16.730 --> 00:32:22.840
Which brings us to Pluton, which at this point
we know is located deep within Wano Country.

00:32:22.840 --> 00:32:29.499
And while we still don’t know what the actual
weapon is, there is a rumor it was a ship

00:32:29.499 --> 00:32:34.120
of some sort, since Franky once had the blueprints
to a ship that could counter Pluton.

00:32:34.120 --> 00:32:38.720
However, there is some mystery about all of
this because apparently Pluton can only be

00:32:38.720 --> 00:32:41.720
released once the borders of Wano are opened.

00:32:41.720 --> 00:32:47.279
Now what that means, we aren’t exactly sure,
but it likely has to do with destroying the

00:32:47.279 --> 00:32:52.130
giant walls that keep Wano separated from
the rest of the world.

00:32:52.130 --> 00:32:57.649
Now, since Poseidon is a power to rule under
the seas and Pluton is likely a ship to dominate

00:32:57.649 --> 00:33:04.190
the surface of the ocean, then it makes sense
that Uranus would be a power that rules the

00:33:04.190 --> 00:33:05.190
air.

00:33:05.190 --> 00:33:08.750
And this may be a brief manga spoiler here,
but we actually got the clearest hint of Uranus’

00:33:08.750 --> 00:33:14.289
power in chapter 1060 of the manga when the
world government’s secret ruler unleashed

00:33:14.289 --> 00:33:19.220
this TERRIFYING power that destroyed the entire
kingdom of Lulusia.

00:33:19.220 --> 00:33:25.630
And wow, I mean, it is literally an island
destroying power, which is pretty strong evidence

00:33:25.630 --> 00:33:29.760
that this is an ancient weapon or something
that was based on one.

00:33:29.760 --> 00:33:34.670
What’s really scary though is that this
weapon is in the World Government’s hands,

00:33:34.670 --> 00:33:39.320
and it makes me wonder if it was this power
that helped them defeat the Ancient Kingdom

00:33:39.320 --> 00:33:41.450
back during the Void Century.

00:33:41.450 --> 00:33:46.660
Now if you’ve been paying attention throughout
so far, you know that the world government

00:33:46.660 --> 00:33:52.010
was formed by twenty original rulers.

00:33:52.010 --> 00:34:00.480
We know who many of these families were, including
the Nefertari family and the Donquixote family.

00:34:00.480 --> 00:34:05.070
And recently in the manga we’ve learned
the names of many more of these founding families.

00:34:05.070 --> 00:34:10.660
But besides their names, what’s most important
is what they actually chose to do after they

00:34:10.660 --> 00:34:12.429
defeated the ancient kingdom.

00:34:12.429 --> 00:34:18.550
Which is of course to leave behind their original
islands and move on top of the Grand Line

00:34:18.550 --> 00:34:20.579
to become the Celestial Dragons.

00:34:20.579 --> 00:34:25.379
And there are theories that these new “gods”,
as they like to think of themselves, moved

00:34:25.379 --> 00:34:29.500
up there because it was the original location
of the Lunarian tribe.

00:34:29.500 --> 00:34:34.099
And if you remember the Lunarians were considered
the previous “gods” of the world, so this

00:34:34.099 --> 00:34:39.570
was like a big, gigantic sign to the world
that the twenty rulers were announcing themselves

00:34:39.570 --> 00:34:41.820
as the new gods of the world.

00:34:41.820 --> 00:34:45.940
And this brings us to another very interesting
bit of history.

00:34:45.940 --> 00:34:52.109
Because these rulers all originally agreed
to rule together instead of appointing a single

00:34:52.109 --> 00:34:53.950
king or queen to rule them all.

00:34:53.950 --> 00:35:01.540
This was symbolized by this mysterious chair
called the Empty Throne, which officially

00:35:01.540 --> 00:35:03.630
no one is supposed to sit on.

00:35:03.630 --> 00:35:09.619
To take it one step further, each of the founding
families placed a weapon in front of the throne

00:35:09.619 --> 00:35:14.060
to show that they were basically laying down
their weapons to work together.

00:35:14.060 --> 00:35:20.760
Of course, we know this was all a giant scam
because at one point the secret ruler Imu

00:35:20.760 --> 00:35:25.849
took control and is now considered the supreme
ruler of the world.

00:35:25.849 --> 00:35:31.450
However, we don’t know if this was how it
was from the start or if Imu took power later

00:35:31.450 --> 00:35:32.450
on.

00:35:32.450 --> 00:35:39.150
In fact, what makes this even more mysterious
is that Imu is from one of the founding families.

00:35:39.150 --> 00:35:45.220
So you could say that Imu was one of the original
twenty rulers or it is also possible that

00:35:45.220 --> 00:35:49.930
they are a descendant who took power sometime
after the world government was formed.

00:35:49.930 --> 00:35:53.040
But we really don’t know at this point.

00:35:53.040 --> 00:35:57.960
However, I actually just lied when I said
ALL of the founding families went up to live

00:35:57.960 --> 00:35:58.960
on Mary Geoise.

00:35:58.960 --> 00:36:04.410
Because one family decided to give up their
right to become world nobles and stayed behind

00:36:04.410 --> 00:36:05.410
on their home island.

00:36:05.410 --> 00:36:11.260
This is of course the Nefertari family and
as we learned recently in the manga, their

00:36:11.260 --> 00:36:15.569
family ruler at the end of the Void Century
was Neferatri Lili.

00:36:15.569 --> 00:36:20.240
While there is still a ton of mystery surrounding
her, we have some pretty strong hints that

00:36:20.240 --> 00:36:26.500
she betrayed the World Government in some
way, most likely something related to the

00:36:26.500 --> 00:36:27.500
poneglyphs.

00:36:27.500 --> 00:36:31.860
But all this means we have some vital questions
that still need to be answered about the early

00:36:31.860 --> 00:36:36.270
years of the world government, and we’ll
get into more theories about this lore in

00:36:36.270 --> 00:36:37.369
just a moment.

00:36:37.369 --> 00:36:41.640
But at this point, it is probably a good thing
that the Celestial Dragons mostly stay away

00:36:41.640 --> 00:36:42.990
from the rest of the world.

00:36:42.990 --> 00:36:46.920
Because as we learned from Doflamingo’s
flashback, when his Celestial Dragon family

00:36:46.920 --> 00:36:52.339
decided to come back and live with the common
people they were instantly rejected and nearly

00:36:52.339 --> 00:36:55.230
executed by a common group of citizens.

00:36:55.230 --> 00:36:59.950
And even though Doflamingo survived this incident,
the Celestial Dragons refused to let him back

00:36:59.950 --> 00:37:05.080
into Mary Geoise because his father had already
given up their status as world nobles.

00:37:05.080 --> 00:37:10.560
So yeah, these nobles are both cruel and they
hold grudges.

00:37:10.560 --> 00:37:17.890
But they also have absolute power in the world
to enslave people, murder, and waste extraordinary

00:37:17.890 --> 00:37:19.010
amounts of money.

00:37:19.010 --> 00:37:26.310
And one of the best examples of this is this
random bridge where Robin was sent after Sabaody.

00:37:26.310 --> 00:37:34.069
This is Tequila Wolf and its story is that
sometime about 700 years ago some world noble

00:37:34.069 --> 00:37:37.160
ordered that a bridge be built between two
islands.

00:37:37.160 --> 00:37:41.770
And here they are still building it all these
years later.

00:37:41.770 --> 00:37:44.619
Now we don’t exactly know the purpose of
this.

00:37:44.619 --> 00:37:51.860
It could have just been a random wish, but
I do wonder if the bridge serves a greater

00:37:51.860 --> 00:37:53.089
purpose.

00:37:53.089 --> 00:37:57.720
Because if you think about it, we know that
the seas, especially in the grand line, are

00:37:57.720 --> 00:38:00.990
ruled by people who can sail like pirates
and marines.

00:38:00.990 --> 00:38:03.960
But maybe the world government decided to
make this bridge so they wouldn’t need to

00:38:03.960 --> 00:38:07.339
rely on ships that could easily be attacked
by pirates.

00:38:07.339 --> 00:38:08.339
Just a thought.

00:38:08.339 --> 00:38:13.410
And another piece of history is that Sanji’s
family, the Vinsmokes, founded their kingdom

00:38:13.410 --> 00:38:17.030
around 250 years ago in the North Blue.

00:38:17.030 --> 00:38:23.070
And while they eventually lost their rule
of the North Blue, they recently played an

00:38:23.070 --> 00:38:25.910
important role in the development of cloning
technology.

00:38:25.910 --> 00:38:30.350
And if you ask me, this is just an insane
development in the world.

00:38:30.350 --> 00:38:35.590
In particular, the Vinsmokes specialize in
mass producing clones to fight in their mercenary

00:38:35.590 --> 00:38:36.590
armies.

00:38:36.590 --> 00:38:41.741
And there are even crazier clones coming up
in Tier 4, but did you even know that some

00:38:41.741 --> 00:38:47.220
parts of the One Piece community once thought
that Luffy might be a clone?

00:38:47.220 --> 00:38:48.559
Crazy, right?

00:38:48.559 --> 00:38:54.050
But you never know, and in fact Luffy’s
family lineage has always been a bit of a

00:38:54.050 --> 00:38:55.050
mystery.

00:38:55.050 --> 00:39:00.071
We know that he has his Grandpa Garp and his
father Dragon, who is the leader of the Revolutionary

00:39:00.071 --> 00:39:01.071
army.

00:39:01.071 --> 00:39:04.980
But we’ve never known about his mother,
which means that now is the perfect time to

00:39:04.980 --> 00:39:11.099
throw in my personal favorite theory that
Crocodile is actually Luffy’s mother.

00:39:11.099 --> 00:39:15.630
And if you’ve never heard this idea, it
comes from the fact that Crocodile and Ivankov,

00:39:15.630 --> 00:39:21.401
who is a gender-morphing officer of the revolutionary
army, have some secret that they won’t tell

00:39:21.401 --> 00:39:22.401
anyone.

00:39:22.401 --> 00:39:27.700
So the idea is that once upon a time Crocodile
was a woman who gave birth to Luffy and then

00:39:27.700 --> 00:39:33.390
had Ivankov change them into a man.

00:39:33.390 --> 00:39:39.609
I’ll just leave it at that for now because
now it is time to dive headfirst into the

00:39:39.609 --> 00:39:47.020
chilly depths of Tier 4, which is lore that
you would really only know if you are a hardcore

00:39:47.020 --> 00:39:48.950
fan of the story.

00:39:48.950 --> 00:39:54.500
And what better way to start this off than
by discussing one of the rarest abilities

00:39:54.500 --> 00:39:57.650
in the entire story: The Voice of All Things.

00:39:57.650 --> 00:40:02.619
Now, you may already know the basics, which
is that the Voice of All Things is a mysterious

00:40:02.619 --> 00:40:07.950
power that allows its users to somehow hear
and understand the voices of creatures and

00:40:07.950 --> 00:40:09.589
objects in the One Piece World.

00:40:09.589 --> 00:40:14.470
For example, when Luffy was about to destroy
this giant ship, he heard the Sea Kings telling

00:40:14.470 --> 00:40:15.730
him to stop.

00:40:15.730 --> 00:40:20.990
And while he couldn’t communicate back,
he could basically understand what was being

00:40:20.990 --> 00:40:21.990
said.

00:40:21.990 --> 00:40:27.030
Other examples include when the future Shogun
of Wano, Momonoske, could understand AND command

00:40:27.030 --> 00:40:28.440
the giant elephant Zunesha.

00:40:28.440 --> 00:40:33.160
But even beyond that, the voice of all things
can let its users understand even written

00:40:33.160 --> 00:40:38.099
text such as that on the Poneglyphs, which
they wouldn’t normally be able to read.

00:40:38.099 --> 00:40:41.990
However, that’s not to say that these users
understand the messages perfectly.

00:40:41.990 --> 00:40:47.430
It is more like they get a vague sense of
what is being communicated.

00:40:47.430 --> 00:40:51.790
What you might not know is that there appears
to be levels of skill with this ability.

00:40:51.790 --> 00:40:58.480
For example, Roger used this ability to understand
the meaning of many poneglyphs by himself,

00:40:58.480 --> 00:41:01.050
which led him to go back and find others.

00:41:01.050 --> 00:41:06.490
On top of that, people like Momo and his father
Kozuki Oden could clearly understand the voice

00:41:06.490 --> 00:41:13.690
of the elephant Zunesha, whereas Luffy could
usually only hear an unrecognizable voice.

00:41:13.690 --> 00:41:18.849
To get into the lore side of this, there are
theories that this ability is caused by super

00:41:18.849 --> 00:41:24.010
strong observation haki and other theories
that the power is tied to certain descendants

00:41:24.010 --> 00:41:28.650
of the ancient kingdom, but we really don’t
know for sure.

00:41:28.650 --> 00:41:34.730
Now, one crazy bit of lore you may have never
heard is that the one piece world might not

00:41:34.730 --> 00:41:36.910
have always been mostly covered by water.

00:41:36.910 --> 00:41:42.960
And while this has never been confirmed, there
are some hints that it is possible.

00:41:42.960 --> 00:41:47.880
For example, the original Wano country was
lost underwater, as we saw at the end of the

00:41:47.880 --> 00:41:48.880
Wano arc.

00:41:48.880 --> 00:41:54.460
This happened&nbsp; because at one point walls
were built up around Wano and rainwater eventually

00:41:54.460 --> 00:41:56.349
filled the space between the walls.

00:41:56.349 --> 00:42:04.861
Plus in chapter 115, we learned that dinosaurs
once freely roamed the world, but now they

00:42:04.861 --> 00:42:06.760
are isolated on this island.

00:42:06.760 --> 00:42:11.849
So it would make sense to me at least that
the world used to have much more land exposed

00:42:11.849 --> 00:42:17.730
and then some natural disaster caused the
world to flood.

00:42:17.730 --> 00:42:22.819
And you might be wondering what kind of natural
disaster could do that, but we actually have

00:42:22.819 --> 00:42:26.680
a clue from chapter 1089 of the manga.

00:42:26.680 --> 00:42:31.000
And fair warning that there will be manga
spoilers for much of the remaining lore.

00:42:31.000 --> 00:42:37.339
So in chapter 1060, we saw the kingdom of
Lulusia erased by what this mysterious power,

00:42:37.339 --> 00:42:43.970
but what’s even crazier is that in chapter
1089 we learned that this event somehow caused

00:42:43.970 --> 00:42:48.800
the sea level all around the world to rise
by one meter.

00:42:48.800 --> 00:42:56.050
Which doesn’t sound like a lot, but man
if you calculate how much water that actually

00:42:56.050 --> 00:43:02.579
is, you get an insane amount like 4 quadrillion
liters of water.

00:43:02.579 --> 00:43:03.579
Like, what??

00:43:03.579 --> 00:43:08.420
How is that even possible from this one single
event?

00:43:08.420 --> 00:43:13.540
And if it really was caused by using this
deadly weapon, just imagine if this weapon

00:43:13.540 --> 00:43:15.880
was used over and over again.

00:43:15.880 --> 00:43:20.690
I’m just saying, it isn’t too insane to
think that the world might’ve once had much

00:43:20.690 --> 00:43:25.980
more land.

00:43:25.980 --> 00:43:30.839
Of course, that is speculation, but if you
want an absolute connection to the disaster

00:43:30.839 --> 00:43:37.210
that wiped Lulusia off the map, look no further
than the giant hole below Enies Lobby.

00:43:37.210 --> 00:43:41.200
I mean, these holes look strikingly similar,
right?

00:43:41.200 --> 00:43:47.240
So we have to imagine that this same weapon
was used at least once before and caused this

00:43:47.240 --> 00:43:49.400
hole underneath the Enies Lobby.

00:43:49.400 --> 00:43:53.849
We have to ask then, what was here that was
wiped off the map?

00:43:53.849 --> 00:43:58.579
Well, it could have been the actual island
home of the ancient kingdom or some other

00:43:58.579 --> 00:44:01.190
important location, like hmm, maybe Laugh
Tale?

00:44:01.190 --> 00:44:06.040
Just saying, it would make sense why no one
has found it if the legendary island realy

00:44:06.040 --> 00:44:09.230
is at the bottom of this giant hole.

00:44:09.230 --> 00:44:15.890
Now, if that was surprising to you just wait
until you hear this next bit of lore because

00:44:15.890 --> 00:44:21.380
recently during the Egghead Island arc we
learned that past civilization was WAY MORE

00:44:21.380 --> 00:44:24.420
technologically advanced than the current
era.

00:44:24.420 --> 00:44:29.790
And even the genius scientist Dr. Vegapunk
told us that he is barely catching up to the

00:44:29.790 --> 00:44:33.380
technology that existed in the distant past.

00:44:33.380 --> 00:44:37.171
Now, of course, we can assume that Vegapunk
is talking about the time before the Void

00:44:37.171 --> 00:44:40.030
Century and the founding of the World Government.

00:44:40.030 --> 00:44:44.480
Which is just completely mind-blowing.

00:44:44.480 --> 00:44:48.960
But to take things even further, many people
assume that the World Government is the one

00:44:48.960 --> 00:44:53.630
who erased much of the technology from the
world.

00:44:53.630 --> 00:44:57.140
And while this could certainly be possible,
I would be very careful about assuming that

00:44:57.140 --> 00:44:59.609
the Government did this for evil reasons.

00:44:59.609 --> 00:45:05.500
I mean, we’ve all seen stories about advanced
civilizations that eventually wipe themselves

00:45:05.500 --> 00:45:10.349
out because of advanced technology or evil
robots, so maybe the world government did

00:45:10.349 --> 00:45:17.230
the world a favor if they truly did rid the
world of most of its technology.

00:45:17.230 --> 00:45:25.710
However, with this knowledge that the world
used to be more advanced, we open up some

00:45:25.710 --> 00:45:28.750
incredible possibilities about the lore of
the ancient world.

00:45:28.750 --> 00:45:33.530
For example, we already discussed that at
one point the winged people of Skypiea and

00:45:33.530 --> 00:45:39.980
Shandora once lived up on the moon, but that
doesn’t mean they always lived there.

00:45:39.980 --> 00:45:45.089
In fact, you might say that they fled up there
to escape oppression just like the minks moved

00:45:45.089 --> 00:45:48.140
up on Zunesha and the fishmen moved under
the sea.

00:45:48.140 --> 00:45:52.930
And with the advanced technology of the past,
this makes a lot more sense that maybe there

00:45:52.930 --> 00:45:59.010
was some sort of spaceship to take all the
winged people up to the moon.

00:45:59.010 --> 00:46:03.550
Although we also have confirmed that the golden
city of Shandora, which was the home of the

00:46:03.550 --> 00:46:08.400
winged-Shandian tribe, was around about 1100
years ago, so clearly they came down off of

00:46:08.400 --> 00:46:11.089
the moon well before the Void Century.

00:46:11.089 --> 00:46:21.410
On top of that, would you believe that DEVIL
FRUITS might also be technology based creations?

00:46:21.410 --> 00:46:26.630
Just think about it, we know that artificial
devil fruits were created using current technology.

00:46:26.630 --> 00:46:31.240
And while some were better than others, can
you just imagine the possibilities of a much

00:46:31.240 --> 00:46:38.760
more advanced society and the powers they
could create?

00:46:38.760 --> 00:46:46.540
Plus, now that we’re discussing it, I even
wonder if this technological advancement is

00:46:46.540 --> 00:46:50.970
what allowed humans to eventually overthrow
the Lunarian race.

00:46:50.970 --> 00:46:57.410
Because remember that the Lunarians were considered
untouchable gods, so something had to change

00:46:57.410 --> 00:47:03.610
in order for humans to basically wipe them
out, and I can certainly imagine new devil

00:47:03.610 --> 00:47:06.010
fruits playing a major role in that.

00:47:06.010 --> 00:47:10.809
Now, as exciting as all these possibilities
are, let’s bring this back to some factual

00:47:10.809 --> 00:47:12.950
lore that we know from the story.

00:47:12.950 --> 00:47:18.890
Because one of the oldest events that we know
of in the entire story is the birth of the

00:47:18.890 --> 00:47:20.230
giant elephant Zunesha.

00:47:20.230 --> 00:47:26.480
They were born well over 1000 years ago and
were closely allied with the legendary Joy

00:47:26.480 --> 00:47:27.480
Boy.

00:47:27.480 --> 00:47:32.980
However, at some point Zunesha committed a
crime and was forced to walk the seas.

00:47:32.980 --> 00:47:38.510
Now, this is the interesting part though because
while we don’t know what crime Zunesha committed,

00:47:38.510 --> 00:47:42.380
we might be able to guess based on its behavior
during the Wano arc.

00:47:42.380 --> 00:47:48.219
Because if you remember, Zunesha briefly came
to Wano right as Luffy awakened Gear 5, but

00:47:48.219 --> 00:47:51.090
it left before it did anything important.

00:47:51.090 --> 00:47:56.010
And we can guess that Zunesha left because
the future shogun Momo decided that it was

00:47:56.010 --> 00:47:58.050
too early to open the borders of Wano.

00:47:58.050 --> 00:48:03.380
So based on this, we can guess that Zunesha’s
main role was to open the borders of Wano,

00:48:03.380 --> 00:48:07.480
which most likely means destroying the walls
that were once built around it.

00:48:07.480 --> 00:48:11.359
Which is just the perfect job for a giant
elephant.

00:48:11.359 --> 00:48:17.900
But the amazing thing is that we can connect
this to what we discussed earlier about Pluton.

00:48:17.900 --> 00:48:22.630
Just to recap, we were told Pluton could not
be used until the borders were opened.

00:48:22.630 --> 00:48:28.700
So that might mean that Zunesha is the key
to unlocking Pluton or maybe Pluton is literally

00:48:28.700 --> 00:48:35.059
buried in the walls and they need Zunesha
to break it open.

00:48:35.059 --> 00:48:39.890
So to tie this back to Zunesha’s crime,
I can just imagine that Zunesha was once supposed

00:48:39.890 --> 00:48:45.890
to help the ancient kingdom by using or unlocking
Pluton but they failed to do so and were then

00:48:45.890 --> 00:48:48.550
forced to walk the earth as punishment.

00:48:48.550 --> 00:48:53.599
However, that is not all about this ancient
elephant, because there are some crazy ties

00:48:53.599 --> 00:48:59.490
between it and the One Piece treasure that
are just too spicy for tier 4, so we’ll

00:48:59.490 --> 00:49:00.640
save them for the next tier.

00:49:00.640 --> 00:49:05.690
What should also be hidden from history is
that Dressrosa has a very dark past when it

00:49:05.690 --> 00:49:06.900
comes to racism.

00:49:06.900 --> 00:49:12.790
That’s because the Donquixote family ruled
Dressrosa before the Void Century.

00:49:12.790 --> 00:49:17.980
During this time, they enslaved the entire
tribe of Tontatta dwarves and forced the dwarves

00:49:17.980 --> 00:49:20.270
to work as slaves for centuries.

00:49:20.270 --> 00:49:26.619
This only ended once the Donquixote family
moved up to Mary Geoise, after the Void Century.

00:49:26.619 --> 00:49:32.150
It was at this time that the Riku family took
over leadership of the island and freed the

00:49:32.150 --> 00:49:39.780
slaves, which led to 800 years of peace until
the warlord Doflamingo came and took back

00:49:39.780 --> 00:49:40.780
the throne.

00:49:40.780 --> 00:49:45.190
Now speaking of special races in one piece,
during the Whole Cake Island arc we learned

00:49:45.190 --> 00:49:49.940
that Big Mom’s dream was to make a paradise
for all of the races of the world.

00:49:49.940 --> 00:49:55.540
And she almost succeeded because members of
basically every race lived in Whole Cake Island

00:49:55.540 --> 00:49:58.500
except for three very special ones.

00:49:58.500 --> 00:50:03.280
The first is the giants, who hated Big Mom
after a potential marriage between their king

00:50:03.280 --> 00:50:06.600
Loki and one of Big Mom’s daughters didn’t
go as planned.

00:50:06.600 --> 00:50:09.510
So you won’t find any of these large folk
walking around.

00:50:09.510 --> 00:50:14.550
The second missing race was revealed during
Wano to be the Lunarians, which actually makes

00:50:14.550 --> 00:50:18.770
sense why there weren’t any in Big Mom’s
territory because Kaido’s right hand man,

00:50:18.770 --> 00:50:22.050
King, is the only known Lunarian still alive.

00:50:22.050 --> 00:50:27.340
And the third missing race was FINALLY revealed
during Kuma’s flashback, which is the Buccaneer

00:50:27.340 --> 00:50:28.340
tribe.

00:50:28.340 --> 00:50:32.930
Interestingly, these people seem to be a cross
between giants and humans due to their incredible

00:50:32.930 --> 00:50:34.170
size and strength.

00:50:34.170 --> 00:50:38.760
And just like the Lunarians, there is only
one confirmed member of this tribe.

00:50:38.760 --> 00:50:41.710
That is the former warlord turned cyborg-slave,
Kuma.

00:50:41.710 --> 00:50:47.920
However, there is actually one other living
creature with Buccaneer blood, and that is

00:50:47.920 --> 00:50:48.920
the Seraphim S-Bear.

00:50:48.920 --> 00:50:54.800
Now to be fair, S-Bear is a genetically modified
clone, not a full- on Buccaneer, but I do

00:50:54.800 --> 00:51:01.309
wonder if somehow this Seraphim will play
a role in restoring the Buccaneer race.

00:51:01.309 --> 00:51:07.970
And while were talking about the Seraphim,
now is a good time to mention that these creatures

00:51:07.970 --> 00:51:14.020
are the only ones in the one piece world who
have devil fruit powers without actually eating

00:51:14.020 --> 00:51:15.020
devil fruit.

00:51:15.020 --> 00:51:20.619
Now before we get too far away from the Buccaneers,
we also have to mention the MIND-BLOWING possibility

00:51:20.619 --> 00:51:26.750
that the ancient figure Nika was actually
a member of the Buccaneer race.

00:51:26.750 --> 00:51:30.790
In case you don’t remember, Nika and Joy
Boy are often referenced when discussing the

00:51:30.790 --> 00:51:36.480
same person from the Void Century, but we
don’t know that they are the same person.

00:51:36.480 --> 00:51:41.460
All we do know is that the elephant Zunesha
declared the Joy Boy had returned at the same

00:51:41.460 --> 00:51:44.680
time that Luffy awakened his Nika devil fruit.

00:51:44.680 --> 00:51:49.240
One thing that is certain though is that the
Buccaneer race knew about Nika and basically

00:51:49.240 --> 00:51:51.490
worshiped him as their savior.

00:51:51.490 --> 00:51:56.270
Plus, if you look at the giant frozen straw
hat in Mary Geoise, it makes a lot more sense

00:51:56.270 --> 00:52:02.700
now that this hat would fit on the head of
an extra large human, like a Buccaneer, rather

00:52:02.700 --> 00:52:04.380
than a full-sized giant.

00:52:04.380 --> 00:52:09.900
So yeah, lots of signs pointing towards a
connection between Joy Boy, Nika, and the

00:52:09.900 --> 00:52:11.240
Buccaneer race.

00:52:11.240 --> 00:52:15.980
Before we go to the insane lore of tier 5
though, let’s head back into Mary Geoise

00:52:15.980 --> 00:52:21.680
because there is of course this mysterious
line about the National Treasure of Mary Geoise.

00:52:21.680 --> 00:52:27.070
This was revealed by Doflamingo, but we never
got to learn what it is.

00:52:27.070 --> 00:52:31.799
It could be something we’ve already seen
like the secret ruler of the world, Imu, the

00:52:31.799 --> 00:52:36.869
mega weapon that destroyed Lulusia, or the
frozen straw hat we just discussed.

00:52:36.869 --> 00:52:42.790
Another option is that it could be some frozen
warriors of the past, I mean why else keep

00:52:42.790 --> 00:52:45.050
a giant secret freezer?

00:52:45.050 --> 00:52:49.680
Or maybe it’s something even more insane
like a secret devil fruit tree that could

00:52:49.680 --> 00:52:53.680
be the original source of the devil fruits.

00:52:53.680 --> 00:52:59.730
We don’t know for sure, but one other interesting
bit of lore about the devil fruits is that

00:52:59.730 --> 00:53:04.490
there is some hint that devil fruits may have
a will of their own.

00:53:04.490 --> 00:53:08.700
This ties into the whole idea that devil fruits
have some sort of spirit or soul of their

00:53:08.700 --> 00:53:13.799
own, and they will naturally seek out people
who represent the core ideas of the fruit.

00:53:13.799 --> 00:53:18.950
The first clear hint we got of this was in
chapter 1044 when the Gorosei said that it

00:53:18.950 --> 00:53:24.040
seemed like the Nika fruit had been evading
them for the past 800 years even though they

00:53:24.040 --> 00:53:25.770
had been trying to capture it.

00:53:25.770 --> 00:53:30.620
And even when we see Luffy awakening his fruit,
it legit seems like he was possessed by some

00:53:30.620 --> 00:53:35.000
kind of maniac spirit that he literally could
not stop laughing.

00:53:35.000 --> 00:53:40.340
So yeah, don’t be surprised if we find out
later that devil fruits actually possess their

00:53:40.340 --> 00:53:43.610
own spirits somehow.

00:53:43.610 --> 00:53:49.840
However, we can’t end tier 4 without bringing
up one of the MOST MYSTERIOUS and LEAST TALKED

00:53:49.840 --> 00:53:52.140
ABOUT objects in the entire story.

00:53:52.140 --> 00:53:54.390
I’m talking about this thing.

00:53:54.390 --> 00:53:55.390
Like, seriously.

00:53:55.390 --> 00:53:56.390
WHAT.

00:53:56.390 --> 00:53:57.390
IS.

00:53:57.390 --> 00:53:58.390
THIS.

00:53:58.390 --> 00:53:59.390
THING?

00:53:59.390 --> 00:54:00.390
It has never been talked about in the story!

00:54:00.390 --> 00:54:01.390
And it is only ever shown on Roger’s ship.

00:54:01.390 --> 00:54:06.040
We do know that he had it after reaching Lodestar
island, which is the second to last island

00:54:06.040 --> 00:54:11.660
on the grand line and the place Roger first
learned about the poneglyphs.

00:54:11.660 --> 00:54:13.950
So maybe he found it there?

00:54:13.950 --> 00:54:15.040
We don’t really know.

00:54:15.040 --> 00:54:17.030
Nor do we know what it is.

00:54:17.030 --> 00:54:21.910
For a long time, community theorists thought
it was a dragon or an ancient weapon, but

00:54:21.910 --> 00:54:23.970
at this point who knows?

00:54:23.970 --> 00:54:30.470
One thing we do know is that it simply has
to reappear before the end of the story.

00:54:30.470 --> 00:54:37.550
Now as we reach the second to last tier of
the iceberg, we are really getting into lore

00:54:37.550 --> 00:54:43.730
and history that requires a TON of analysis
and even some speculation.

00:54:43.730 --> 00:54:48.950
And if you know all of this already, you are
most likely a professional One Piece fan.

00:54:48.950 --> 00:54:54.020
For example, did you know that just like the
real world, many events in the One Piece world

00:54:54.020 --> 00:54:55.760
are cyclical?

00:54:55.760 --> 00:54:59.790
Which means that they happen over and over
again throughout the centuries.

00:54:59.790 --> 00:55:04.650
And Oda even shows us this by having similar
arcs between the Pre and Post timeskip.

00:55:04.650 --> 00:55:07.980
For example, Alabasta and Dressrosa are both
very similar.

00:55:07.980 --> 00:55:12.790
In Alabasta, a Warlord nearly took over a
kingdom but was stopped by Luffy.

00:55:12.790 --> 00:55:18.970
Then in Dressrosa a Warlord did successfully
take over a country before they were stopped

00:55:18.970 --> 00:55:19.970
by Luffy.

00:55:19.970 --> 00:55:24.220
Another example is Arlong Park and Fishman
Island, which both dealt with the issue of

00:55:24.220 --> 00:55:25.220
racism.

00:55:25.220 --> 00:55:26.549
Now, why is this important?

00:55:26.549 --> 00:55:32.349
Well, because if we take the idea that events
happen in cycles then you can surely bet that

00:55:32.349 --> 00:55:36.680
the events of the Void Century are going to
be repeated in the present story.

00:55:36.680 --> 00:55:42.780
The key difference though is that Luffy will
most likely succeed where the past Joy Boys

00:55:42.780 --> 00:55:43.780
failed.

00:55:43.780 --> 00:55:47.630
And this ultimately means that Luffy will
be successful in uniting all of the races

00:55:47.630 --> 00:55:49.950
of the world to live freely all across the
world.

00:55:49.950 --> 00:55:54.670
I mean, he’s already basically done that
with all of his allies and friends he has

00:55:54.670 --> 00:55:55.869
made along the way.

00:55:55.869 --> 00:56:01.420
And this time when the world government attempts
their “Great Cleansing” Luffy and his

00:56:01.420 --> 00:56:03.840
friends will be able to stop it.

00:56:03.840 --> 00:56:08.559
And while this Great Cleansing is sure to
be a truly awful event, I bet you’ll be

00:56:08.559 --> 00:56:14.910
surprised when I tell you that the world’s
secret ruler Imu may not be as bad as you

00:56:14.910 --> 00:56:15.910
think.

00:56:15.910 --> 00:56:20.569
And this takes some digging into his family
name, which is Nerona.

00:56:20.569 --> 00:56:27.049
Now, while we don’t know for sure, this
family name could have been inspired by the

00:56:27.049 --> 00:56:33.150
Roman Emperor Nero, who has a ton of interesting
history and connections to Imu.

00:56:33.150 --> 00:56:39.109
First, he ruled over Rome at the very end
of what is considered the Julio-Claudian dynasty,

00:56:39.109 --> 00:56:44.140
just like Imu is ruling over what will likely
be the end of the World Government era.

00:56:44.140 --> 00:56:49.420
On top of that, Nero is usually considered
one of the worst emperors for some awful acts

00:56:49.420 --> 00:56:52.730
that he is said to have done, like burning
the city of Rome.

00:56:52.730 --> 00:56:57.790
However, if you dive a bit deeper into his
history there are a bunch of false myths and

00:56:57.790 --> 00:57:02.520
legends about Nero that make him seem A LOT
worse than he was.

00:57:02.520 --> 00:57:08.739
And I won’t get into those here, but if
Nero really was the inspiration for Imu then

00:57:08.739 --> 00:57:13.400
there might be a whole other story to Imu
that we still don’t know.

00:57:13.400 --> 00:57:19.049
So I’m not saying he’s a good guy, but
it’s definitely possible that he is more

00:57:19.049 --> 00:57:22.010
than just a simply evil dictator.

00:57:22.010 --> 00:57:27.589
Now speaking of Imu’s family, at this point
in the manga, we know many of the family names

00:57:27.589 --> 00:57:29.270
of the original twenty rulers.

00:57:29.270 --> 00:57:33.920
They are Nerona, Donquixote, Nefertari as
well as the names of the five Elders which

00:57:33.920 --> 00:57:38.819
are Jaygarcia, Marcus, Topman, Ethanbaron,
and Shepherd.

00:57:38.819 --> 00:57:44.970
We may also have another founding family,
the Garling family, but they haven’t been

00:57:44.970 --> 00:57:47.359
confirmed as one of the original twenty kings.

00:57:47.359 --> 00:57:54.260
And now to bring this back to Neferatri Lili,
while we don’t know what happened to her

00:57:54.260 --> 00:57:59.289
at the end of the Void Century, we do know
that she somehow disappeared.

00:57:59.289 --> 00:58:03.589
So it is possible she was hunted down and
killed by the world government.

00:58:03.589 --> 00:58:07.940
Another option is that she went on to create
the Island of Women, Amazon Lili, since they

00:58:07.940 --> 00:58:11.170
share the same name.

00:58:11.170 --> 00:58:20.510
Either way, something happened between Lili
and Imu which led Lili to reject the other

00:58:20.510 --> 00:58:23.070
nobles and side with the Ancient Kingdom.

00:58:23.070 --> 00:58:28.210
But before we move on from Imu, one last shocking
bit of lore is that Imu might actually be

00:58:28.210 --> 00:58:29.920
some kind of child.

00:58:29.920 --> 00:58:35.270
Now, we’ve long thought that Imu and the
Gorosei might be immortal, but there are some

00:58:35.270 --> 00:58:39.289
clues that Imu might have had their age frozen
while they were a kid.

00:58:39.289 --> 00:58:43.369
For example, his speech style in Japanese
is very similar to that of a child.

00:58:43.369 --> 00:58:48.960
Plus, if you’ve ever seen Imu sitting on
the Empty throne, they always appear extraordinarily

00:58:48.960 --> 00:58:49.960
small.

00:58:49.960 --> 00:58:54.680
Now the throne might just be massive, but
don’t rule out the possibility that they

00:58:54.680 --> 00:58:58.440
are a child or someone with a very small body.

00:58:58.440 --> 00:59:03.850
We don’t know exactly why they are so child-like,
but it likely has to do with their mysterious

00:59:03.850 --> 00:59:04.850
power.

00:59:04.850 --> 00:59:08.849
In fact, we already have a devil fruit that
freezes your age, which is the Hobby Hobby

00:59:08.849 --> 00:59:14.190
no mi, and its user was a child who literally
forced people to become toy slaves, so I’m

00:59:14.190 --> 00:59:19.549
just saying that this kind of ability has
already happened in the story.

00:59:19.549 --> 00:59:26.430
Now, this next bit of lore stretches way back
even before the Void Century because did you

00:59:26.430 --> 00:59:32.390
know that the Long Arm and Long legs tribes
have been having some sort of war for over

00:59:32.390 --> 00:59:34.380
one thousand years!

00:59:34.380 --> 00:59:35.709
Crazy right?

00:59:35.709 --> 00:59:39.049
While the rest of the world was battling it
out during the void century, these dudes were

00:59:39.049 --> 00:59:42.730
just over here fighting each other.

00:59:42.730 --> 00:59:48.580
And this next bit of lore will honestly shock
you, and it has to do with the current story.

00:59:48.580 --> 00:59:53.910
That’s because did you know that we have
never had a single person actually drown during

00:59:53.910 --> 00:59:56.260
the current story?

00:59:56.260 --> 01:00:01.799
Which is just mind-boggling if you ask me,
so surely that means that Oda is saving this

01:00:01.799 --> 01:00:04.970
awful fate for some important part of the
story right?

01:00:04.970 --> 01:00:07.780
Maybe for Imu or Blackbeard or something.

01:00:07.780 --> 01:00:12.320
If that happens at all though it will likely
be at the very end of the story, which is

01:00:12.320 --> 01:00:17.000
also when we should finally find Laugh Tale
and find the One Piece.

01:00:17.000 --> 01:00:21.750
However, did you know that Oda may have been
laying clues about the origin of Laugh Tale

01:00:21.750 --> 01:00:25.750
and the Ancient Kingdom right in front of
our eyes this whole time?

01:00:25.750 --> 01:00:26.980
Let me explain.

01:00:26.980 --> 01:00:31.750
We learned during the Skypiea arc that part
of the island of Jaya was launched up into

01:00:31.750 --> 01:00:32.750
the sky.

01:00:32.750 --> 01:00:37.300
And when you put these two pieces together
it forms the shape of a skull.

01:00:37.300 --> 01:00:38.750
Classic pirate stuff, right?

01:00:38.750 --> 01:00:43.660
Well, if you look carefully at this skull
shaped map you might also notice that the

01:00:43.660 --> 01:00:46.710
left eye of the skull is missing.

01:00:46.710 --> 01:00:49.450
Which at first glance might not mean anything.

01:00:49.450 --> 01:00:54.500
I mean it is an island after all and they
usually aren’t perfectly shaped, but when

01:00:54.500 --> 01:00:58.720
you dig into the symbolism of the left eye
throughout the story, you will learn that

01:00:58.720 --> 01:01:02.980
the left eye plays a significant, although
hidden, role.

01:01:02.980 --> 01:01:08.520
Because a missing or closed left eye shows
up quite frequently on volume covers that

01:01:08.520 --> 01:01:11.890
discuss the World Government, Void Century,
or the Ancient kingdom.

01:01:11.890 --> 01:01:16.680
For example, in volume 11, Nami here has her
left eye closed and in this volume, Luffy

01:01:16.680 --> 01:01:21.630
and the crew defeat Arlong, save Nami’s
village, and throw a massive feast to celebrate.

01:01:21.630 --> 01:01:26.049
So really hitting on the themes for freedom,
laughter, and celebration.

01:01:26.049 --> 01:01:30.539
Then we have volume cover 27 where Luffy has
his left eye closed and in this volume we

01:01:30.539 --> 01:01:36.900
have the panel of Luffy looking like NIka
dancing by the fire as well some other conversations

01:01:36.900 --> 01:01:41.750
about the golden bell and it has similarities
to the drums of liberation.

01:01:41.750 --> 01:01:46.910
And there are many more examples of left eyes
being closed during important volumes such

01:01:46.910 --> 01:01:50.100
as these.

01:01:50.100 --> 01:01:55.720
But the important thing is that during all
these volumes we are learning important lore,

01:01:55.720 --> 01:02:01.760
so clearly there is a tie between the left
eye and the ancient lore.

01:02:01.760 --> 01:02:06.960
We also have many important scars such as
Luffy, Garp, and Zoro’s being on the left

01:02:06.960 --> 01:02:11.500
eye and Luffy’s father’s tattoo being
on the left side, so all of this leads me

01:02:11.500 --> 01:02:16.560
to believe that this missing left eye on the
island of Jaya is just too significant to

01:02:16.560 --> 01:02:17.560
ignore.

01:02:17.560 --> 01:02:21.359
Whether that missing piece is Laugh Tale or
maybe the home of the ancient kingdom, I’m

01:02:21.359 --> 01:02:26.049
not 100% sure but don’t be surprised if
it shows up again in the future.

01:02:26.049 --> 01:02:34.260
However, it’s now time for the deepest,
juiciest bits of lore in One Piece, starting

01:02:34.260 --> 01:02:40.120
with the fact that Imu might truly be a demon
or some sort of nightmare creature.

01:02:40.120 --> 01:02:45.750
There were hints of this during chapters 1085
and 1086 when we saw his shadowy silhouette,

01:02:45.750 --> 01:02:51.530
but even more evidence is during chapter 1094
when we see this demon-like transformation

01:02:51.530 --> 01:02:54.110
from one of the Gorosei, Saint Saturn.

01:02:54.110 --> 01:02:55.330
And I mean, wow!

01:02:55.330 --> 01:03:01.640
No one was expecting this, and while these
abilities are still a mystery, it truly makes

01:03:01.640 --> 01:03:09.910
me believe that the Gorosei and Imu might
be devils or have some sort of demonic powers.

01:03:09.910 --> 01:03:15.220
What’s really interesting about the Gorosei
and Imu though, is that we have been explicitly

01:03:15.220 --> 01:03:18.849
told that they have natural enemies in the
D. clan.

01:03:18.849 --> 01:03:22.670
Now I’m sure at this point you know that
there are many people all around the world

01:03:22.670 --> 01:03:26.059
with the initial D such as Monkey D. Luffy
and his family.

01:03:26.059 --> 01:03:29.250
There’s also Gol D. Roger and his son, Ace.

01:03:29.250 --> 01:03:34.450
Plus, this giant is also a D. Even someone
like Law has the initial D, and we recently

01:03:34.450 --> 01:03:40.201
learned that Nefertari Lili was Nefertari
D. Lili, which means that Vivi, who the straw

01:03:40.201 --> 01:03:45.480
hats befriended early in the story, is also
technically a member of the D clan.

01:03:45.480 --> 01:03:49.539
So clearly these D. clan members are not all
related by blood, but you may be surprised

01:03:49.539 --> 01:03:55.320
to learn that we got a big hint about the
origins of the D clan in a brief recent flashback.

01:03:55.320 --> 01:04:01.049
In chapter 1085, we learned that Luffy and
Ace told Sabo that he could have the D initial

01:04:01.049 --> 01:04:03.940
in his name too since he was their friend.

01:04:03.940 --> 01:04:08.480
And while you might think that they are just
messing around as kids, I highly doubt Oda

01:04:08.480 --> 01:04:13.140
would just throw this in there if it didn’t
have real significance later on.

01:04:13.140 --> 01:04:18.319
So it might very well be that the D clan were
a bunch of friends who banded together and

01:04:18.319 --> 01:04:22.770
adopted this secret initial in order to stand
up for their beliefs.

01:04:22.770 --> 01:04:27.890
However, this next bit of lore is even more
secret because it is now time to talk about

01:04:27.890 --> 01:04:31.310
the important role of whales in the story.

01:04:31.310 --> 01:04:34.920
Now, we already mentioned Laboon and how he
was waiting at the start of the Grand Line

01:04:34.920 --> 01:04:39.190
for his friends to return, but did you know
that there are many other connections between

01:04:39.190 --> 01:04:40.610
whales and Laugh Tale?

01:04:40.610 --> 01:04:45.860
For example, in chapter 8, there was a whale
fountain in the same chapter Nami is looking

01:04:45.860 --> 01:04:47.910
for a map to the Grand Line.

01:04:47.910 --> 01:04:54.020
Then at the start of the Grand Line, Laboon
is literally the first thing the crew sees.

01:04:54.020 --> 01:04:57.869
And then what happens when they enter the
second half of the Grand Line?

01:04:57.869 --> 01:05:01.060
You guessed it, a whole pod of whales.

01:05:01.060 --> 01:05:05.930
Then the first time we see a Road Poneglyph
it is literally inside of a Whale Tree.

01:05:05.930 --> 01:05:11.549
So clearly Oda is making a point that whales
are an important piece of this whole puzzle.

01:05:11.549 --> 01:05:21.619
On top of that, we know whales love music
and in particular the song Binks Sake, which

01:05:21.619 --> 01:05:24.660
is a pirate song that is connected to the
One Piece.

01:05:24.660 --> 01:05:28.710
Now you might be wondering what does this
all have to do with the One Piece treasure?

01:05:28.710 --> 01:05:33.220
Well, let’s go back to Laboon for a second
because when the crew gets trapped inside

01:05:33.220 --> 01:05:37.630
of the whale they meet the doctor Crocus who
is taking care of Laboon from the inside.

01:05:37.630 --> 01:05:42.670
And we now know that Crocus was part of Roger’s
crew when they found the one piece, and he

01:05:42.670 --> 01:05:45.480
had his own little island inside of Laboon.

01:05:45.480 --> 01:05:52.720
So all of this could be hints that the island
Laugh tale is inside of a giant Whale.

01:05:52.720 --> 01:05:56.730
And when you combine this with the Deep Water
currents that we learned about in chapter

01:05:56.730 --> 01:06:02.869
604, it all adds up to a very good explanation
for why only Roger and his crew have been

01:06:02.869 --> 01:06:05.839
able to find Laugh Tale in over 800 years.

01:06:05.839 --> 01:06:11.609
Which is because the island might actually
be inside of a whale that has been hiding

01:06:11.609 --> 01:06:16.480
in the Deep Water Currents, and can only be
found using a certain method described on

01:06:16.480 --> 01:06:17.480
the Road Poneglyphs.

01:06:17.480 --> 01:06:22.430
And it all fits with the idea of whales and
friendship especially since we know that the

01:06:22.430 --> 01:06:27.160
Ancient Kingdom already had a connection with
another giant creature, Zunesha.

01:06:27.160 --> 01:06:32.779
Now, while this is of course partially a theory,
we cannot deny that the clues are there.

01:06:32.779 --> 01:06:38.619
Just like how I know that if you’ve been
watching this entire time, you either absolutely

01:06:38.619 --> 01:06:44.859
love one piece and have nothing better to
do, or you are slaving away doing your chores

01:06:44.859 --> 01:06:46.000
or working.

01:06:46.000 --> 01:06:54.520
So luckily for you, I have the perfect thing
to keep you going with A MASSIVE One Piece

01:06:54.520 --> 01:06:59.910
